    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thunder</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς μεγάλοιο κεραυνὸν δεινήν τε β</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.199
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ βροντῆς πατρὸς Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.796
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζηνός τε βροντῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.121
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστραπὴ καὶ β</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.86
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. στεροπῇ τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. καὶ κεραυνίᾳ φλογί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1017
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντῆς μύκημα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1062
			</span></i> (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1083
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. δ᾽ ἐρράγη δι᾽ ἀστραπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					578
				</span></i>
			, etc.: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OC</u>
				1514
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.6.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθόνιαι β</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1745
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτου τὰς β. οἶδ᾽ ὅτι δείσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					98.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the state of one struck with thunder, astonishment</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεάν σφι θεὸς ἐμβάλῃ β</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.10
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έ. </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρομτᾱ</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέμω</span>.)</div>
